<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Morph_Edit">Morph Edit</span></h2>
<p>Hello, I just have a question pertaining to your edit on the <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Morph" title="Morph">Morph</a> page with the subhead "How to replace the morph of an in game NPC (Single Player Campaign)". When I access the creatures and try to find an NPC, there are none. All I can find are monsters and a few "test" NPC's, but none that are actually in the game. Is there an extra resource source that includes NPC's and the companions? I cannot find them anywhere in the Toolset. 
</p><p>Thanks for any help. --<a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/User%20-%20Tricause" title="User:Tricause (page does not exist)">Tricause</a> 01:44, 30 December 2009 (UTC)
</p><p>1. Make sure you have version 1.0.1008.0 installed
</p><p>2. File --&gt; Manage Modules --&gt; Switch to "Single Player" then click "open"
</p><p>3. Now try my tutorial.
</p>
<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Headtracking_performance_bug">Headtracking performance bug</span></h2>
<p>Hi, thanks for the bug report! It appears to be something we already encountered and addressed, but which wasn't covered in the existing documentation for headtracking. I've added the solution (the <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/File%20-%20IconAccurateHeadtracking.png"><img alt="IconAccurateHeadtracking.png" src="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/main/assets/mw/images/1/17/IconAccurateHeadtracking.png" width="16" height="16" /></a> button in the toolbar) to the documentation, let me know if that doesn't solve your performance issues and reopen <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Bug%20-%20cutscene%20editor%20in%20toolset%20lags%20when%20headtracking%20is%20set" title="Bug: cutscene editor in toolset lags when headtracking is set">Bug: cutscene editor in toolset lags when headtracking is set</a> with more details if needed. <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/User%20-%20BryanDerksen" title="User:BryanDerksen">BryanDerksen</a> 21:38, 18 January 2010 (UTC)
</p>
